Package: vswarehouse
Title: Client for the vs-warehouse Statistical Data API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Virtus Solutions", email = "api@virtus-solutions.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides convenient access to the vs-warehouse REST API
    (<https://api.virtus-solutions.io>), which serves official economic and
    demographic time series from Stats NZ, the ABS, OECD, and more.
    Source-specific functions (vs_get_statsnz(), vs_get_oecd(), etc.) return
    tidy data frames ready for analysis, and vs_plot() produces a quick
    ggplot2 line chart from any result.
